  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enguri Hydro Power Plant Rehabilitation Project: Climate Resilience Upgrade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Fourth stage of rehabilitation works of the Enguri HPP with the objectives to increase the HPPs resilience to climatic variability and climate change; allow for the safe operation of the HPP at full capacity; and contribute to confidence-building between the Government of Georgia and the breakaway region of Abkhazia. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
